<title>POLAND: PPWK PLANS 1996 DIVIDEND AT PLN 0.25.</title>
<headline>PPWK PLANS 1996 DIVIDEND AT PLN 0.25.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Poland's PPWK</p>
<p>map-maker will vote on April 25 on the management's proposal on</p>
<p>dividing the company's 4.51 million zloty net profit for last</p>
<p>year, which earmarks 15 percent for dividend.</p>
<p>						 Annually</p>
<p>				Latest  1996	     Prior 1995</p>
<p> Amount (PLN)		    0.25		     0.50</p>
<p> Pay				Sept 1		   Aug 30</p>
<p> Record			   May 15		   May 15</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the Polish company is Polskie</p>
<p>Przedsiebiorstwo Wydawnictw Kartograficznych im. Eugeniusza</p>
<p>Romera SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
